  "notes": "Measurements are MATLAB table objects, decoded from the MCOS subsystem. Part 1 groups age from beginning of life; parts 2 and 3 continue after middle of life. Table columns TestTime and Amphr have no unit in the file. n_entities (27) is not a clean cell count: it mixes genuine numbered battery cells (20 numbered Cell IDs among Cell1..Cell27) with 6 auxiliary full-cell/half-cell reference files (CH_FC_POCV.mat, CH_HC_anode.mat, CH_HC_cathode.mat, DCH_FC_POCV.mat, DCH_HC_anode.mat, DHC_HC_cathode.mat - characterization/reference files, not six additional independently identified batteries) plus one oddly-named TPG3.8-cell14.mat. The closeness of 27 to the registry's 28 is partly coincidental: real cells are undercounted, offset by these non-cell files. The prior protocol summary incorrectly included 1C; the three author READMEs instead state C/4 or C/2 cycling. Recorded C-rate maxima refer to the explicitly stated cycling/reference constant-current rates; pulse-characterization amplitudes are not specified in those lists."
 },
